      "writtenOn": "2024-09-25T13:41:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we really need this clarification that it may be a combination? A lot of this comment seems to suggest being 0 could be optional. Instead could this all be rewritten to say that \"If the samplerData is 0 then it is a dynamic sampler and we push back a default SamplerDesc. Dynamic samplers only take up 1 unit32_t in the samplerData.\"",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 262,
        "startChar": 11,
        "endLine": 262,
        "endChar": 85
      },
      "revId": "a20ff7afeac38833e0bea33358316f07d2d9b078",
